{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every day\u2019s the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making beds, taking out trash, vacuuming, and surprises no one asked for. People leave all kinds of things behind here... some of them say something about who they are, leave a clue\u00a0 and imagination does the rest. But\u2026 there are people you really don\u2019t want to get to know. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734400/extras/13e55a05403df9719079c8ad848c2a3a.poster.avif?t=1773050337\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734400/extras/13e55a05403df9719079c8ad848c2a3a.webm?t=1773050337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, life rarely listens to what you want. It hands you a script you can\u2019t prepare for. That\u2019s why it\u2019s worth choosing a way to play where improvisation feels natural.\u00a0My style? Noir -\u00a0Because  every chapter is a mystery that needs solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734400/extras/0ee3e20daa4efb3e9402d62a6423ff23.poster.avif?t=1773050337\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734400/extras/0ee3e20daa4efb3e9402d62a6423ff23.webm?t=1773050337\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Interactive Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room Service Work Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noir-Inspired Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph